OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Lump on head was cancer eating
OL,4,Ahole in my skull'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Medway woman is raising awareness
OL,7,Fafter a golfball-sized lump on her
OL,8,Fforehead turned out to be an incurable
OL,9,Fblood cancer which had eaten a hole in
OL,10,Fher skull.
OL,12,FKatrina Fox had joked with mates about
OL,13,Fher growth at first, even nicknaming it
OL,14,F'Bert', while her GP initially
OL,15,Fdiagnosed it as a harmless cyst.
OL,17,FBut when the 38-year-old from Rochester
OL,18,Ftried to have it removed she was told
OL,19,Fby medics that they had found a tumour,
OL,20,Falong with 3cm gap in her cranium
OL,21,Fthrough which they could see her brain.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
